lexreq:aiact-art10-5-e-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How is the deletion of those data ensured once the bias has been corrected or the retention period has ended, whichever occurs first?"@en .

lexreq:aiact-art10-5-f a lexreq:Requirement ;
