lexreq:aiact-art10-5-f-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Do the records of processing activities include the reasons as to why the processing of special categories of personal data is strictly necessary to detect and correct biases?"@en ; lexreq:formalisedBy "cq/art10_5f_processing_records.rq" .
lexreq:aiact-art10-5-f-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How is it recorded that that objective could not be achieved by processing other data?"@en .

