lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What is the procedure for keeping the technical documentation up-to-date?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq4 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the technical documentation demonstrate that the high-risk AI system complies with the requirements set out in this Section?"@en ; lexreq:formalisedBy "cq/art11_1_evidence_per_requirement.rq" .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq5 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Does the technical documentation provide in a clear and comprehensive form at least the requirements set out in Annex IV for the national competent authorities and notified bodies to assess the compliance of the AI system against these requirements?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq6 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What elements set out in Annex IV are contained in the technical documentation?"@en ; lexreq:formalisedBy "cq/art11_1_annex_iv_elements.rq" .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq7 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Is the system creator an SME or startup?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq8 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What elements of the technical documentation specified in Annex IV are provided in a simplified manner?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq9 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "If the system provider is an SME or startup, is the more simplified technical documentation provided by the Commission being used?"@en ; lexreq:formalisedBy "cq/art11_1_sme_simplified_documentation.rq" .
lexreq:aiact-art11-1-cq10 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How is that form used for the purposes of the conformity assessment?"@en .

