lexreq:aiact-art17-4-cq1 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What internal governance, arrangement or process requirements under Union financial services law apply to the provider?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art17-4-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How is the obligation to put in place a quality management system deemed to be fulfilled by complying with those rules?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art17-4-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How are paragraph 1 points (g), (h) and (i) addressed?"@en .
lexreq:aiact-art17-4-cq4 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What harmonised standards referred to in Article 40 are taken into account?"@en .
