lexreq:altai-r2-10-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What mechanisms does the AI system use to monitor whether it is meeting its intended goals?"@en .
lexreq:altai-r2-10-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system define and test the contexts and conditions required for reproducibility?"@en .

