lexreq:altai-r3-02-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system implement DPIA, DPO involvement, access controls, logging, privacy-by-design, and data minimisation measures where applicable?"@en ; lexreq:formalisedBy "cq/altai_r3_dpia.rq" .
lexreq:altai-r3-02-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system evidence these governance controls across its lifecycle?"@en .

