lexreq:altai-r4-03-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What mechanisms does the AI system use to communicate the purpose, criteria, benefits, limitations, and risks of its decisions?"@en .
lexreq:altai-r4-03-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system provide training materials and disclaimers that enable appropriate use?"@en .

lexreq:altai-r5-01 a lexreq:Requirement ;
