lexreq:altai-r5-01-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What operational controls does the AI system apply to prevent bias during design, development, validation, and deployment?"@en .

lexreq:altai-r5-02 a lexreq:Requirement ;
    skos:inScheme lexreq: ;
    lexreq:framework lexreq:ALTAI ;
    lexreq:sortKey "2-altai-r5-02" ;
    rdfs:label "Requirement 5: Diversity, Non-discrimination and Fairness / Avoidance of Unfair Bias, item 2"@en ;
    lexreq:section "Requirement 5: Diversity, Non-discrimination and Fairness" ;
    dcterms:source "ALTAI, Requirement 5: Diversity, Non-discrimination and Fairness / Avoidance of Unfair Bias" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/library/assessment-list-trustworthy-artificial-intelligence-altai-self-assessment> ;
    dcterms:description "Did you consider diversity and representativeness of end-users and/or subjects in the data?\nDid you test for specific target groups or problematic use cases?\nDid you research and use publicly available technical tools, that are state-of-the-art, to improve your understanding of the data, model and performance?\nDid you assess and put in place processes to test and monitor for potential biases during the entire lifecycle of the AI system (e.g. biases due to possible limitations stemming from the composition of the used data sets (lack of diversity, non-representativeness)?\nWhere relevant, did you consider diversity and representativeness of end-users and or subjects in the data?"@en ;
    lexreq:usesTerm aidoc:Dataset , aidoc:ModelEvaluation , aidoc:PerformanceMetric , aidoc:TrainingDataSheet , aidoc:hasSourceDataset , aidoc:qualityMetricsUsed ;
    lexreq:expectedEvidence "Dataset representativeness analysis"@en ;
    lexreq:expectedEvidence "Fairness evaluation report by subgroup"@en ;
    lexreq:expectedEvidence "Problematic use-case test suite"@en ;
    lexreq:expectedEvidence "Bias monitoring dashboard"@en ;
    aiact:hasCompetencyQuestion lexreq:altai-r5-02-cq1 , lexreq:altai-r5-02-cq2 , lexreq:altai-r5-02-cq3 .
lexreq:altai-r5-02-cq1 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system assess diversity and representativeness of end-users or subjects in the data it uses?"@en .
lexreq:altai-r5-02-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What tests does the AI system apply for specific target groups, problematic use cases, and lifecycle bias monitoring?"@en .
lexreq:altai-r5-02-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system use state-of-the-art tools to analyse data, model behaviour, and performance for bias-related concerns?"@en .

