lexreq:altai-r5-04-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "What escalation paths and reporting channels does the AI system provide for raising such issues?"@en .
lexreq:altai-r5-04-cq3 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system identify directly and indirectly affected subjects when such issues arise?"@en .

