lexreq:altai-r7-03-cq2 a lexreq:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "How does the AI system maintain third-party oversight beyond development and into deployment or operation?"@en .

lexreq:altai-r7-04 a lexreq:Requirement ;
