    aiact:hasCompetencyQuestion lexreq:gender-06-cq1 , lexreq:gender-06-cq2 , lexreq:gender-06-cq3 , lexreq:gender-06-cq4 , lexreq:gender-06-cq5 , lexreq:gender-06-cq6 , lexreq:gender-06-cq7 .
